{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c678f0a1-9052-8ac3-a7c7-548196942b84",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T10:35:46-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisa P. Fortes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:32:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:32:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Marisa Fortes. I have a few questions about voting, early voting specifically."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:33:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, happy to help. Is this for an upcoming election in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:33:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Whatever is the next one that I am eligible for. I want to know the dates for early voting, so I can plan my week. I run a small business, so my schedule is, um, not flexible."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:33:19-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Early voting, which we call in-person early voting here, usually opens about twenty days before an election and runs through the day before. The exact dates depend on which election it is. Do you know which one you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:33:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am not certain. I think there may be a special election coming. I do not have the date written down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:33:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. The state posts the calendar for each election, and we can also tell you when you call closer to the date. I can also mail you the schedule once one is set. Is your voter registration current at your address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:33:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I registered a long time ago. I have not moved. Now, the second question. What identification do I need to bring? Is it a driver's license only, or can it be something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:34:07-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It doesn't have to be a driver's license. For in-person voting, Rhode Island asks for a valid photo ID. That can be a license, a passport, a US military ID, a student ID, or a state-issued ID, things like that. Some other documents with your name and address are accepted too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:34:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So a passport would work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:34:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A passport works, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:34:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And if the license is expired? I have one that expired last year. I am not sure it still counts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:34:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For voting, an expired ID has been accepted in some cases, but I wouldn't rely on that. If you have a passport that's current, bring that. Or you can get the license renewed. That's through the registry, not us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:34:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that is the registry. I will bring the passport. That is simpler."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:34:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Anything else I can do for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:34:58-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One more detail. I am usually in the workshop late. I build model trains in a spare room, so I lose track of time. Are the early voting hours during the day only, or are there some evenings?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:35:11-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Model trains, that's a great project. Hours are mostly weekdays during regular business hours, and there can be some extended days. I'd want the schedule in front of me for the specific election. Want me to take your number and send it when it's posted?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:35:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. The number is four zero one, five five five, zero one seven four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:35:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four zero one, five five five, zero one seven four. Marisa Fortes, F-O-R-T-E-S, correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:35:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Thank you, that was clear. That is everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:35:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T10:35:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
